# Repository line-ending contract.
#
# Tracked text files are stored as LF in the Git index and checked out as LF in
# the working tree on every platform. `eol=lf` makes this repository-authoritative,
# so the result no longer depends on a developer's global `core.autocrlf` setting.
# The generators in scripts/ assemble and compare their output in LF, so an LF
# working tree keeps `npm run check:html` and `npm run build:html` idempotent.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets tracked in this repository: never apply text or EOL conversion.
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
